ntTop\' onclick=\'timeLineLink()\' data-contType=\'0\' data-contId=\'32736695\' data-optType=\'0\'> <div class=\\\"topic_tl_link\\\"> <div class=\'time_jiantou\'></div> <div class=\\\"timeline_detail\\\">查看详情</div> </div> </div> </div> </li> <li class=\'timeline_event\'> <div class=\'timeline_contentTop\'> <div class=\'timeline_pie\'></div> <span>03:47</span> </div> <div class=\'timeline_contentbottom \' onclick=\'timeLineLink()\' data-is-link=\'1\' data-forward-type=\'0\' data-contType=\'0\' data-contId=\'32736381\' data-optType=\'0\'> 克宫：普京与特朗普通电话，就尽快结束伊朗战事提建议 <div class=\'timeline_contentTop\' onclick=\'timeLineLink()\' data-contType=\'0\' data-contId=\'32736381\' data-optType=\'0\'> <div class=\\\"topic_tl_link\\\"> <div class=\'time_jiantou\'></div> <div class=\\\"timeline_detail\\\">查看详情</div> </div> </div> </div> </li> </ul> <ul class=\'timeline_content\'> <li class=\\\"timeline_timeli\\\"> <div class=\'timeline_contentTop\'> <div class=\'timeline_empty\'></div> <div class=\'timeline_time\'>2026-03-09</div> </div> </li> <li class=\'timeline_event\'> <div class=\'timeline_contentTop\'> <div class=\'timeline_pie\'></div> <span>19:30</span> </div> <div class=\'timeline_contentbottom \' onclick=\'timeLineLink()\' data-is-link=\'1\' data-forward-type=\'0\' data-contType=\'0\' data-contId=\'32733976\' data-optType=\'0\'> 普京致电祝贺穆杰塔巴当选伊朗最高领袖 <div class=\'timeline_contentTop\' onclick=\'timeLineLink()\' data-contType=\'0\' data-contId=\'32733976\' data-optType=\'0\'> <div class=\\\"topic_tl_link\\\"> <div class=\'time_jiantou\'></div> <div class=\\\"timeline_detail\\\">查看详情</div> </div> </div> </div> </li> <li class=\'timeline_event\'> <div class=\'timeline_contentTop\'> <div class=\'timeline_pie\'></div> <span>16:12</span> </div> <div class=\'timeline_contentbottom \' onclick=\'timeLineLink()\' data-is-link=\'1\' data-forward-type=\'0\' data-contType=\'0\' data-contId=\'32733003\' data-optType=\'0\'> 实锤！美媒给出美军“战斧”袭击伊朗小学证据 <div class=\'timeline_contentTop\' onclick=\'timeLineLink()\' data-contType=\'0\' data-contId=\'32733003\' data-optType=\'0\'> <div class=\\\"topic_tl_link\\\"> <div class=\'time_jiantou\'></div> <div class=\\\"timeline_detail\\\">查看详情</div> </div> </div> </div> </li> <li class=\'timeline_event\'> <div class=\'timeline_contentTop\'> <div class=\'timeline_pie\'></div> <span>05:56</span> </div> <div class=\'timeline_contentbottom \' onclick=\'timeLineLink()\' data-is-link=\'1\' data-forward-type=\'0\' data-contType=\'0\' data-contId=\'32730918\' data-optType=\'0\'> 伊朗议会议长：选择穆杰塔巴为最高领袖这一决定“精准且明确” <div class=\'timeline_contentTop\' onclick=\'timeLineLink()\' data-contType=\'0\' data-contId=\'32730918\' data-optType=\'0\'> <div class=\\\"topic_tl_link\\\"> <div class=\'time_jiantou\'></div> <div class=\\\"timeline_detail\\\">查看详情</div> </div> </div> </div> </li> <li class=\'timeline_event\'> <div class=\'timeline_contentTop\'> <div class=\'timeline_pie\'></div> <span>05:11</span> </div> <div class=\'timeline_contentbottom \' onclick=\'timeLineLink()\' data-is-link=\'1\' data-forward-type=\'0\' data-contType=\'0\' data-contId=\'32730837\' data-optType=\'0\'> 穆杰塔巴·哈梅内伊当选伊朗新任最高领袖 <div class=\'timeline_contentTop\' onclick=\'timeLineLink()\' data-contType=\'0\' data-contId=\'32730837\' data-optType=\'0\'> <div class=\\\"topic_tl_link\\\"> <div class=\'time_jiantou\'></div> <div class=\\\"timeline_detail\\\">查看详情</div> </div> </div> </div> </li> <li class=\'timeline_event\'> <div class=\'timeline_contentTop\'> <div class=\'timeline_pie\'></div> <span>04:20</span> </div> <div class=\'timeline_contentbottom \' onclick=\'timeLineLink()\' data-is-link=\'1\' data-forward-type=\'0\' data-contType=\'0\' data-contId=\'32730652\' data-optType=\'0\'> 美中央司令部：对伊朗军事行动中已有7名美军士兵死亡 <div class=\'timeline_contentTop\' onclick=\'timeLineLink()\' data-contType=\'0\' data-contId=\'32730652\' data-optType=\'0\'> <div class=\\\"topic_tl_link\\\"> <div class=\'time_jiantou\'></div> <div class=\\\"timeline_detail\\\">查看详情</div> </div> </div> </d