ine_detail\\\">查看详情</div> </div> </div> </div> </li> <li class=\'timeline_event\'> <div class=\'timeline_contentTop\'> <div class=\'timeline_pie\'></div> <span>20:12</span> </div> <div class=\'timeline_contentbottom \' onclick=\'timeLineLink()\' data-is-link=\'1\' data-forward-type=\'0\' data-contType=\'0\' data-contId=\'32748821\' data-optType=\'0\'> 伊朗武装部队发言人：“对等反击”已结束，将实施“连环打击” <div class=\'timeline_contentTop\' onclick=\'timeLineLink()\' data-contType=\'0\' data-contId=\'32748821\' data-optType=\'0\'> <div class=\\\"topic_tl_link\\\"> <div class=\'time_jiantou\'></div> <div class=\\\"timeline_detail\\\">查看详情</div> </div> </div> </div> </li> <li class=\'timeline_event\'> <div class=\'timeline_contentTop\'> <div class=\'timeline_pie\'></div> <span>19:28</span> </div> <div class=\'timeline_contentbottom \' onclick=\'timeLineLink()\' data-is-link=\'1\' data-forward-type=\'0\' data-contType=\'0\' data-contId=\'32748619\' data-optType=\'0\'> 伊朗称发动“真实承诺4”第38波攻势，重创美军多个基地 <div class=\'timeline_contentTop\' onclick=\'timeLineLink()\' data-contType=\'0\' data-contId=\'32748619\' data-optType=\'0\'> <div class=\\\"topic_tl_link\\\"> <div class=\'time_jiantou\'></div> <div class=\\\"timeline_detail\\\">查看详情</div> </div> </div> </div> </li> <li class=\'timeline_event\'> <div class=\'timeline_contentTop\'> <div class=\'timeline_pie\'></div> <span>19:27</span> </div> <div class=\'timeline_contentbottom \'>“美国制造”！伊朗公布袭击女子学校的导弹残片画面</div> </li> <li class=\'timeline_event\'> <div class=\'timeline_contentTop\'> <div class=\'timeline_pie\'></div> <span>19:26</span> </div> <div class=\'timeline_contentbottom \' onclick=\'timeLineLink()\' data-is-link=\'1\' data-forward-type=\'0\' data-contType=\'0\' data-contId=\'32748599\' data-optType=\'0\'> 以军称对伊朗基础设施发起大规模打击 <div class=\'timeline_contentTop\' onclick=\'timeLineLink()\' data-contType=\'0\' data-contId=\'32748599\' data-optType=\'0\'> <div class=\\\"topic_tl_link\\\"> <div class=\'time_jiantou\'></div> <div class=\\\"timeline_detail\